      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## 🧬 Series Profile Layer\n\nA generic podcast episode template can be specialized by a series profile such as **Episode of Candace**.\n\nThe profile may provide:\n\n- parent work\n- default creator\n- default platforms\n- inherited artwork\n- numbering conventions\n- standard audience tags\n- default experience nodes\n- series-specific resources\n\nThe concrete episode supplies only the values that change.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784513387877,
